kon, red nuoc dressing with your choice of chicken | crispy tofu | prawns | beef</description><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:46:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Elvis Presley - Little Sister - YouTube</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ca0pPIwXGqY</link><description>"Elvis Presley's ""Little Sister"" is a classic rock and roll song originally released in 1961."</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:23:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Elvis Presley - Little Sister Lyrics &amp; Meaning</title><link>https://www.songlyrics.com/elvis-presley/little-sister-lyrics/</link><description>Written by Doc Pomus and Mort Shuman, the song tells the story of a young man who was previously romantically involved with an older girl who repeatedly rejected and mistreated him. Now he turns his attention to her younger sister, seeking both romantic interest and perhaps a subtle form of revenge.</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:04:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>